meta {
  name: Get ASH attendance detail
  type: http
  seq: 20
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/ash/attendance/{{id}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  id: fa1fac17-bfe6-49a3-982d-3403ed43fb32
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Get ASH Attendance Detail
  
  Retrieves the full detail of a single ASH weekly attendance record by its unique identifier.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                              |
  |-----------|--------|----------|------------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the weekly attendance record     |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the complete ASH weekly attendance record. Student UUID arrays are resolved to full names via a batch lookup against the ASH student table.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "sessionDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
      "studentsInAttendance": ["First Surname", "First Surname"],
      "studentsMentored": ["First Surname", "First Surname"],
      "sessionsConducted": ["string"] | null,
      "sessionDetails": "string" | null,
      "volunteersInAttendance": "string",
      "programReview": "string" | null,
      "updatedAt": "ISO 8601" | null,
      "createdAt": "ISO 8601",
      "deletedAt": "ISO 8601" | null
    },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ### Response Fields (`data`)
  
  | Field                    | Type       | Description                                                                      |
  |--------------------------|------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | id                       | string     | UUID primary key.                                                                |
  | sessionDate              | string     | Date of the attendance session (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                                   |
  | studentsInAttendance     | string[]   | Resolved full names (`"First Surname"`) of students who attended.                |
  | studentsMentored         | string[]   | Resolved full names (`"First Surname"`) of students who were mentored.           |
  | sessionsConducted        | string[]   | Array of session types conducted (nullable).                                     |
  | sessionDetails           | string     | Free-text details about the session (nullable).                                  |
  | volunteersInAttendance   | string     | Names/details of volunteers present.                                             |
  | programReview            | string     | Overall review of the programme session (nullable).                              |
  | updatedAt                | string     | ISO 8601 timestamp of last update (nullable).                                    |
  | createdAt                | string     | ISO 8601 timestamp of record creation.                                           |
  | deletedAt                | string     | ISO 8601 soft-delete timestamp (nullable).                                       |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                        |
  |-----------------------------|----------------------------------------------------
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).        |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                           |
}
